[{"title":"赠友人冯集梧","author":"王至甸","text":"春风吹我过君家，门外人惊三朵花。\n一笑不知谁醉醒，相携重与数年华。\n松窗对酒听新雨，蜡屐寻山入晚霞。\n拟抱青琴鼓招隐，知君久已厌筝琶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29007,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜读道藏有作","author":"王至甸","text":"探得玄珠道眼醒，庚申空守只劳形。\n忽然虚室夜生白，自诧灵台火养青。\n大月危楼堪独啸，天风高笛落残星。\n无人解我还丹诀，试取微吟记画屏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29008,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋江晚步","author":"张永亮","text":"缓步秋江十里堤，閒吟古寺夕阳西。\n同人共酌黄花酒，谷口寒鸦傍晚啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29009,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"溪柳","author":"张永亮","text":"迥迥山光接，烟迷柳一溪。\n临风谁弄笛，喜雨自听鹂。\n樵斧隔深谷，渔舟系短堤。\n颦眉送行客，不尽夕阳西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29010,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次陶先生以自题王廉生祭酒遗墨见示敬赋长句","author":"郭恩孚","text":"无为斋墙土花碧，悲风飒飒响通夕。\n墨耶泪耶不可知，白头老儒对镫泣。\n金荃兰畹楚臣骚，丹凤城中鬼夜号。\n翠华西幸华山高，孤臣之魂安足招。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29011,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盘山","author":"智朴","text":"苍松乱插连云石，石上苔痕虎行迹。\n拄杖来从飞鸟边，下视苍茫远烟碧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29012,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人日龚芝麓邓孝威垂访海幢寺","author":"今释","text":"胜流坐对即空山，未碍梅花笑任还。\n风雨杂陈今昔梦，松筠长护死生关。\n珠川空写何年泪，玉竹犹分一样斑。\n此去相思无远近，曹溪元不隔人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29013,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题","author":"今释","text":"老怕应休学少年，忧时成结喜成颠。\n无弦得弄琴三叠，有伴裁看石一拳。\n闭户钞方偏伏枕，因人博饭愧栽田。\n杨花又现浮萍相，水泛风飘不异缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29014,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臷庵","author":"今释","text":"落叶平坡外，骑牛古寺还。\n一回风雨过，几幅米家山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29015,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"独往","author":"弘智","text":"同伴都分手，麻靴独入林。\n一年三变姓，十字九椎心。\n听惯干戈信，愁因风雨深。\n死生容易事，所痛为知音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29016,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙酉腊月二十四夜","author":"弘智","text":"故乡风俗重今夜，儿女班班列堂下。\n今当树折巢破时，羽毛零落怜枯枝。\n旅舍檐前一回首，上有白发下黄口。\n望空剪纸告坟墓，两眼泪接三杯酒。\n难道年年坐死苦海中，愿为落叶随飘风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29017,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"听黔调山坡羊","author":"弘智","text":"调自边关到石城，此方弦管更多情。\n游人借得东风力，吹入江南后一声。\n犹忆秦淮赛《竹枝》，青楼沈水易相思。\n眼看到处生离别，何故多弹《子夜》词。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29018,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"宏仁","text":"茅屋禁寒昼不开，梅花消息早先回。\n幽人记得溪桥路，双屐还能踏雪来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29019,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宫人入道和唐人","author":"南潜","text":"听断昭阳鼓吹声，道家衣向御前更。\n已抛团扇三秋怨，却胜琵琶万里行。\n留锦只谋装秘笈，买丝还拟绣飞琼。\n天家异日赍香使，白发宫奴记旧名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29020,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别吴中诸子","author":"读彻","text":"相见了无意，临歧还黯然。\n回看吴苑树，独上秣陵船。\n春老还山路，江昏欲雨天。\n白鸥颇怪我，聚散绿波前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29021,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中峰喜逢白公夜集法公方丈","author":"读彻","text":"久别几于消息断，重逢犹记道途閒。\n两山相忆秋同老，一夜刚随雨到山。\n故旧何人堪共话，林峦有主暂投閒。\n乱流落叶声兼下，听彻寒扉不上关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29022,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送友之敬亭","author":"读彻","text":"君读书，我拍歌，留君不住奈君何！\n閒者孤云飞者鸟，我山我水何曾少？\n独怜知己是敬亭，开门终日双眼青。\n安得秦王驱出边，芙蓉一片当我前。\n君亦不须去，山亦不须住，竹月松风对床语。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29023,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自云栖过湖上杂咏","author":"读彻","text":"春水平湖绿映堤，六桥芳草正萋萋。\n东风不为游人待，催尽桃花衬马蹄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29024,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石公山","author":"实䚮","text":"湖上山忽起，突兀孤云中。\n洪涛日相击，飞雪洒晴空。\n悬崖疑欲堕，怪异由天工。\n雨晴苍翠湿，水落根玲珑。\n时有好事者，闲来穷鸿蒙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29025,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江楼望月","author":"实䚮","text":"江村犹不夜，月已到高楼。\n碧瓦光相射，虚檐影自流。\n山山皆在水，树树尽成秋。\n天迥空无著，西风一钓舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29026,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜同凝父宿元朗斋头有怀秋潭","author":"实䚮","text":"帘外丝丝雨，因风亦易晴。\n孤灯照清话，一钵了浮生。\n野鸟不依树，闲云偶入城。\n悬知溪上意，流水是经声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29027,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜过元弘山房","author":"实䚮","text":"忽动幽人思，昏黄过草堂。\n江明初上月，地白已凝霜。\n相见更何事，岁寒心不忘。\n石床终夕语，松隙又晨光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29028,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾茂伦村居","author":"炤影","text":"持竿傲楚使，长啸将何之。\n人生各有志，与世无心期。\n卓哉顾夫子，隐耕东皋菑。\n卷书挂牛角，冲烟出茅茨。\n幽禽啭高松，望空宏遐思。\n时呼渔人饮，问月来何迟。\n回眸瞻北斗，阴云凝天池。\n放歌忽挥涕，今古事如斯。\n且复倒金樽，生涯何足知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29029,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴茂申见过感赋","author":"炤影","text":"秋风飒飒独相过，说尽艰辛鬓已皤。\n莫道故乡烟火少，祇缘江岸鼓鼙多。\n江山万里看黄雾，松竹荒园坐绿莎。\n冠盖寥寥休问讯，五侯茅土近如何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29030,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郭无伤邝无畏见过","author":"函是","text":"金栗如来是后身，澄潭孤月净无尘。\n看同镜里人何似，话到声销道易亲。\n铁树开残寒腊焰，雪花藏得旧年春。\n水云上下深深意，鹤影松虬好结邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29031,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"弹子矶 其二","author":"光鹫","text":"欲买丹青写十洲，谁知茎草即琼楼。\n真山真水无人量，笑煞当年顾虎头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29032,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答关茂才子璿 其一","author":"光鹫","text":"之子信殊众，飘飘琼树枝。\n相逢端水上，不觉还山迟。\n独鹤下高树，怒蛙喧一池。\n嚣尘满天地，何处可扬眉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29033,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答关茂才子璿 其二","author":"光鹫","text":"峡江如净练，明月近中秋。\n舍此不肯住，无人堪与游。\n遣愁凭笔研，借梦宿渔舟。\n梦起各挥手，白云天际头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29034,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送智峰禅者还丹霞","author":"光鹫","text":"年来慧命似悬丝，鼠啮枯藤信可悲。\n老我无缘方退院，怜君有志乃工诗。\n相逢不枉花前约，后会难寻石上期。\n想到丹霞冰欲泮，试看岩桂几生枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29035,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游鼓山喝水岩","author":"通容","text":"岩上草色肥，岩下水流急。\n策杖上岩颠，山空人独立。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29036,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登天目遇雨","author":"听月","text":"荒山无道路，云气随我身。\n渐觉笠檐重，沾袂细如尘。\n幽花齐吐艳，仙鸟群相亲。\n泉石自太古，耳目愈清新。\n银河忽倒泻，云际垂天绅。\n可望不可即，对立峰嶙峋。\n阵云如滚马，归云如悬鹑。\n身立云气上，看云态弥真。\n下山脚下袜，细草藉如茵。\n尘世日方杲，阴晴气不均。\n试将山中景，说与山下人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29037,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿北里先生","author":"涌狂","text":"短发投荒又一年，每逢山寺便留连。\n远公自爱寻陶令，吏部曾无识大颠。\n一片钟声和骨冷，半边月色可人怜。\n文章节义浑閒事，何日还题到白莲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29038,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿搕?大师","author":"涌狂","text":"土床閒坐啜黄齑，得句时翻经背题。\n义胆久拚沙暴骨，禅心不学絮黏泥。\n难期苏子看羝乳，长伴支公听马嘶。\n塞外无花拈雪示，何人微笑各凄凄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29039,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿搕?大师","author":"大铃","text":"终年长许傍孤筇，翘首云飞第一峰。\n瓶汲几乾湘水浪，鱼敲欲起鼎湖龙。\n既收残骨埋花雨，又召游魂听雪钟。\n五岭三山当此日，清泉共酌祝寒松。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29040,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿北里先生","author":"正羞","text":"竹杖方袍久不疑，萧然茗碗雪来时。\n枯桐未卖宁堪爨，古墨多残足疗饥。\n已过虎溪难强笑，欲投鱼腹亦成痴。\n但将泡影看身世，海角天涯月一池。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29041,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家","author":"正岩","text":"田家无他望，所望在平畦。\n但恐终岁力，不得遂其私。\n何哉造物者，亦得厚我施。\n夜来微雨过，使我菜麦滋。\n登丘一以眺，秀色远参差。\n此时桃与李，岂乏好容姿。\n顾予朴野性，独与此相宜。\n及时务耕作，那敢贪天时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29042,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄岩小橘甚佳喜题一绝","author":"正嵓","text":"橘花如雪忆长洲，橘子黄时到古瓯。\n多谢吴天怜梦远，飞霜酿出洞庭秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29043,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄啸翁","author":"济日","text":"毛子称方外，西溪两大家。\n尔诗应不忝，吾愧实无涯。\n踪迹溪山杳，音书岁月赊。\n相思一回首，寒月在梅花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29044,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题曹将军水庙","author":"显鹏","text":"断碣依江口，荒祠落照平。\n人烟双径出，古木一桥横。\n水国蛟龙气，灵台鸟雀声。\n千秋功业在，庙貌独峥嵘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29045,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄紫凝","author":"显鹏","text":"参差亭榭岁华新，湖上幽居傍水滨。\n词赋终能为弃物，桑麻自可作閒人。\n林光不断飘残雪，草色无穷望好春。\n婚嫁少完儿女事，早来东郭结比邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29046,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日吴山宴集值雨次韵","author":"序灯","text":"吟怀未许老重阳，霜雪无端入鬓长。\n几度白衣虚令节，致疑黄菊是孤芳。\n野心一片湖云外，灏气三秋海日傍。\n山阁若逢阎伯屿，方君诗思敌王郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29047,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送友之吴门","author":"海遐","text":"东风吹柳拭烟轻，折赠柔条空复情。\n一望吴山千万叠，知君只在此中行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29048,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鼎湖篇赠尹紫芝内翰","author":"同揆","text":"鼎湖龙去秋溟溟，惊风吹雨秋山青。\n白头中翰泪凝霰，叫霜断雁栖寒汀。\n烈皇御宇十七载，身在深宫心四海。\n一朝地老与天荒，城郭依稀人事改。\n当年删定《南薰曲》，内殿填词徵召促。\n琴张好学直乾清，先公屡赐金莲烛。\n雅乐推君独擅场，望春楼下拜君王。\n《高山》一奏天颜喜，奉敕新翻旧典章。\n昭仪传谕何谆切，予赉先颁女儿葛。\n上林避暑抚丝桐，温语贞娥遵秘诀。\n流泉石上坐相邀，薇省风清玉佩摇。\n神武门前轻执戟，永和宫里薄吹箫。\n如意初殇泪沾臆，那堪又报河南失。\n钿蝉零落葬田妃，池水苍茫尚凝碧。\n寒食花飞不见春，冬青冢树斫为薪。\n煤山一片凄凉月，犹照疆场血化磷。\n世间万境须臾梦，老臣剩有西台恸。\n四十年来寄食艰，何人再听《高山弄》。\n鉴湖南去云门外，古寺松篁景晻霭。\n维舟无意忽相逢，恍惚梦魂同晤对。\n夕阳影里话前朝，天寿诸陵王气消。\n留得闲身师白足，满头白发影飘萧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29049,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜宿八峰山房","author":"大灯","text":"黄花篱下乱蛩鸣，古寺秋高岭月明。\n夜半石床清睡去，不知枕上落泉声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29050,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔村","author":"荫在","text":"枯藤络危石，略彴不可渡。\n渔路淡如烟，烟中有人住。\n忽闻欸乃声，长短自成句。\n棹入明月湾，幽村隔云树。\n芦花风萧萧，秋水飞白鹭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29051,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访隐","author":"荫在","text":"问尽采樵者，无人知隐君。\n万山最深处，相随惟孤云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29052,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过王皓庵旧居却寄郡城","author":"本源","text":"菰城摩诘在，久不住岩阿。\n白日携筇到，青山送客多。\n林空一片月，涧落万重波。\n知我无如子，秋深几度过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29053,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄胡柏庵","author":"大宇","text":"时有渡江梦，孤怀历岁深。\n淡云归鸟意，春树野人心。\n岸草青连屋，山花红满林。\n好知千古事，明日几回寻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29054,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居","author":"大成","text":"一株两株老松青，松下结个小茅亭。\n三日五日来一次，肩荷楖栗手持经。\n读经读到山月出，听松听罢天落星。\n适然抛卷松间卧，梦与松根乞茯苓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29055,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日访超果青壁禅师赋赠","author":"雪峰","text":"步屧重来此，幽期隔岁年。\n梅香寒雨尽，竹密碧云连。\n窜迹沈痾里，开襟老宿前。\n春星今夜黑，不觉烛花偏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29056,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送钱圣桢赴佟方伯楚幕之招","author":"元志","text":"江月照孤舟，有客鸣素琴。\n天风指端起，调高思何沈。\n借问所念谁，楚国有遗音。\n庾月南楼好，陶柳西门深。\n羊公岘山顶，今有谁登临。\n思欲一相访，芳踪何处寻。\n寻此亦云易，远行难为心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29057,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次官雪眉刺史韵","author":"玉","text":"投老归丘壑，竹中门懒开。\n岚光扫不去，云影拂还来。\n花发蜂争蜜，斋馀鸟下台。\n层岩怀故旧，日上两三回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29058,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游范靖赤南庄","author":"玉","text":"曙色践云背，乘驴下岱岑。\n为寻南郭子，偶度北城阴。\n相见忘宾主，倾怀恣笑吟。\n素磁传菉竹，共慰出尘心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29059,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"天河","author":"玉","text":"谁向青天建禹功，一河高凿势沈雄。\n两崖星似人竞渡，万里光如练扫空。\n静对霜庭思汗漫，偶逢月夜影朦胧。\n灵槎何日重相访，独指仙源一放篷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29060,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶成 其一","author":"玉","text":"住山不得意，多为山有名。\n安得无名山，寂寞终此生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29061,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶成 其二","author":"玉","text":"行到无人处，山深云更深。\n一泉藏众石，悠然见古心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29062,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史","author":"蜀乔","text":"花尽春阑闭草庐，从容论古寸阴馀。\n汉朝兴废凭三杰，楚国存亡出二胥。\n有客逃名身似叶，何人弹铗食无鱼。\n安贫老衲忘年月，一枕松风梦亦虚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29063,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访蒋虎臣居士","author":"道贤","text":"孤亭云外落，坐拥万山秋。\n海色连京口，江声过石头。\n何人成隐遁，与子独相求。\n古寺多红叶，谁能无事游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29064,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"武塘吴文昭为余写行脚图戏赠","author":"元璟","text":"人物名家旧姓吴，一枝神笔近来无。\n赵州故事谁相委，写我青山行脚图。\n眼看青白面无文，鹤骨何妨瘦几分。\n竹笠芒鞋多逸韵，超然一片入山云。\n霜华欲白月轮低，隔水思君玉观西。\n哦就小诗聊作答，争如孔雀换山鸡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29065,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送顾云驭广文之太平","author":"元璟","text":"绛帐南行吾道东，钱塘江上鲤鱼风。\n百年儒雅推名世，三绝风流属老翁。\n天姥闲游听虎瑟，石华戏采蹑蛟宫。\n来春拟著谢公屐，华顶同看初日红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29066,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄鹂二首似杜湘草","author":"元璟","text":"新晴碧柳著烟轻，并坐交鸣最有情。\n记得酸风吹箬笠，段桥阴里两三声。\n桃花如雨草如烟，第六桥边剧可怜。\n分付江南飘荡客，不须更唱《鹧鸪天》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29067,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西溪结茅奉酬蛰图翁先生","author":"元璟","text":"入山愧未入深山，黄茅一把丛翠间。\n扫花饲鹤起我早，了无别事分馀闲。\n西溪溪水白于絮，旧是先生垂钓处。\n茶烟竹粉满溪香，不碍轻鸥自来去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29068,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惠山寺品第二泉","author":"元璟","text":"山水洵有缘，兹行爱风便。\n帆峭五两轻，百里如劈箭。\n爰访惠山泉，先游惠山院。\n惠山青崔嵬，泉声绕殿转。\n华桷吐云霞，朱甍映藻茜。\n古树发新绿，竟体里苍藓。\n径造泉上亭，鉴斯癯仙面。\n渟泓窦方满，小汲瘿瓢溅。\n碧乳花尚浮，寒玉香不卷。\n一酌已洒然，再漱泠然善。\n平生淡泊肠，尽化为冰霰。\n昨过扬子江，中泠浑莫辨。\n僧寮曾瀹试，虚名怪独擅。\n鸿渐昏老子，舌本何其谫。\n错品落第二，千载徒扼腕。\n况我枯槁人，回首重眷恋。\n定携折脚铛，住老龙山涧。\n竹炉煮松风，雪瓯点秋片。\n月取三百斛，日与诗魔战。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29069,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝词 其一","author":"元璟","text":"段桥一段可怜春，草似裙腰柳曲尘。\n明镜不流山色去，画船多载醉归人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29070,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]